#
# ⚠️  IMPORTANT: Replace the placeholder values below with your REAL Supabase credentials.
#
# HOW TO GET YOUR CREDENTIALS:
# 1. Go to https://app.supabase.com
# 2. Open your project (or create a new one)
# 3. Go to Settings → API
# 4. Copy "Project URL" (looks like: https://abcdefghijk.supabase.co)
# 5. Copy "anon public" key (starts with: eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...)
# 6. Paste them below
#
# AFTER UPDATING THIS FILE:
# - Save the file
# - Restart your dev server (Ctrl+C, then npm run dev)
# - Visit http://localhost:5173/config-check to verify
# - Then try registering a new account
#
# ============================================

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
